157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (In the contemporary digital publishing and educational content industry, maintaining immaculate factual precision, structural clarity, and typographical excellence is essential for impactful knowledge transfer. Digital manuscript curation involves integrating structured editorial techniques with computer-assisted document analysis tools. During this internship at GURUsys Learning, the primary objective was to audit, edit, fact-check, and standardize educational book drafts across multiple subject areas before pre-press typesetting and digital release.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
