<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Raw academic manuscripts prepared by diverse authors invariably contain discrepancies ranging from mechanical typos, awkward syntactic structures, and inconsistent header hierarchies to unverified scientific figures and outdated citations. Releasing unvetted educational manuscripts creates serious challenges:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
